{"id":"3df866ee4574e842","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-interior.md","title":"Interior","display":"df-interior — Interior","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-interior","aliases":["58-df-interior","Interior"],"display":"df-interior — Interior","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-open-set.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-interior"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-interior</span><span>Interior</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-interior — Interior"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c664c247a9331632\" href=\"?note=c664c247a9331632\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-open-set.md\">../batch02/58-df-open-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-topology.md\">../batch14/58-df-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X, \\tau)\">\\((X, \\tau)\\)</span> (topological space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\subseteq X\">\\(A \\subseteq X\\)</span> (subset)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in X\">\\(x\\in X\\)</span> (point)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{int}_\\tau(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{int}_\\tau(A)\\)</span> (interior of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}interior} \\vdash \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A\\subseteq X\\to\\left(\\operatorname{int}_\\tau^X(A)\\coloneqq\\bigcup\\{U\\in\\tau:U\\subseteq A\\}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}interior} \\vdash \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A\\subseteq X\\to\\left(\\operatorname{int}_\\tau^X(A)\\coloneqq\\bigcup\\{U\\in\\tau:U\\subseteq A\\}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}interior} \\vdash \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land x\\in X\\to\\left(x\\in\\operatorname{int}_\\tau^X(A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\land U\\subseteq A)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}interior} \\vdash \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land x\\in X\\to\\left(x\\in\\operatorname{int}_\\tau^X(A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\land U\\subseteq A)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}interior} \\vdash \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A\\subseteq X\\to\\left(\\operatorname{cl}_\\tau^X(A)\\coloneqq X\\setminus\\operatorname{int}_\\tau^X(X\\setminus A)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}interior} \\vdash \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A\\subseteq X\\to\\left(\\operatorname{cl}_\\tau^X(A)\\coloneqq X\\setminus\\operatorname{int}_\\tau^X(X\\setminus A)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}interior} \\vdash \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A\\subseteq X\\to\\left(\\partial_\\tau^X A\\coloneqq\\operatorname{cl}_\\tau^X(A)\\setminus\\operatorname{int}_\\tau^X(A)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}interior} \\vdash \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A\\subseteq X\\to\\left(\\partial_\\tau^X A\\coloneqq\\operatorname{cl}_\\tau^X(A)\\setminus\\operatorname{int}_\\tau^X(A)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ambient carrier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> and the topology premise are explicit in every operator clause; this prevents the same <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>-notation from silently changing universes.</li>\n<li>Interior: union of all open subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>; largest open contained in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span></li>\n<li>Closure: complement of interior of complement; smallest closed superset</li>\n<li>Boundary: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\partial A = \\overline{A} \\setminus \\operatorname{int}(A)\">\\(\\partial A = \\overline{A} \\setminus \\operatorname{int}(A)\\)</span>; neither interior nor exterior</li>\n<li>Interior operator: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\mapsto \\operatorname{int}(A)\">\\(A \\mapsto \\operatorname{int}(A)\\)</span> is deflationary, monotone, idempotent</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Munkres, Topology</li>\n<li>Willard, General Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-open-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"c664c247a9331632","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-open-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(X, \\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"A \\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{int}_\\tau(A)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}interior} \\vdash \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A\\subseteq X\\to\\left(\\operatorname{int}_\\tau^X(A)\\coloneqq\\bigcup\\{U\\in\\tau:U\\subseteq A\\}\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}interior} \\vdash \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land x\\in X\\to\\left(x\\in\\operatorname{int}_\\tau^X(A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\land U\\subseteq A)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}interior} \\vdash \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A\\subseteq X\\to\\left(\\operatorname{cl}_\\tau^X(A)\\coloneqq X\\setminus\\operatorname{int}_\\tau^X(X\\setminus A)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}interior} \\vdash \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A\\subseteq X\\to\\left(\\partial_\\tau^X A\\coloneqq\\operatorname{cl}_\\tau^X(A)\\setminus\\operatorname{int}_\\tau^X(A)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\partial A = \\overline{A} \\setminus \\operatorname{int}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"A \\mapsto \\operatorname{int}(A)","display":false}],"bytes":1981,"backlinks":[{"id":"db1cdbf32eacfd38","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)$ (topological-space predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-interior.md]])"},{"id":"7ed45c59f7913947","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{int}_\\tau^X$ 与 $\\operatorname{cl}_\\tau^X$ 使用 [[../batch04/58-df-interior.md]] 中带载体的算子。"},{"id":"c36cc156fef49a61","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-229","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-interior]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-697","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-interior.md|58-df-interior]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["c664c247a9331632","e7514bc4cefba4f2","815e63e5071e7b58"]}